* EMMI1 -- EDMMST client inquiry screen
* CLIENTID is an unprotected input field.
MAP EMMI1 SIZE 24x80
  FIELD HEADER   AT 0,2   LEN 60 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD CLIENTID AT 3,20  LEN 8  UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD CLTYPE   AT 5,20  LEN 1  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD RANK     AT 5,30  LEN 2  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD LNAME    AT 6,20  LEN 20 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD FNAME    AT 6,42  LEN 15 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD DEPT     AT 7,20  LEN 20 PROT DIM    COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD LOC      AT 7,45  LEN 3  PROT DIM    COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD STATF    AT 8,20  LEN 1  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD MESSAGE  AT 10,5  LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD FOOTER   AT 23,2  LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=BLUE
ENDMAP
